<title>BELGIUM: Nato declines comment on fighting in Iraq.</title>
<headline>Nato declines comment on fighting in Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The North Atlantic Treaty Organisation's spokesman on Saturday declined all comment on reports of armed conflict in northern Iraq.</p>
<p>But a NATO official told Reuters: &quot;We are watching the situation closely.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier on Saturday, an Iraqi Kurd leader said both Iraqi troops and Kurdistan Democratic Party (KDP) forces were attacking the city of Arbil in northern Iraq.</p>
</text>
